  "query_preview": "Period (Monday through Thursday)... \nMonday will feature a quick surge of warm air ahead of the next\ncold front, as highs top out near record highs in the mid to \nupper 80s. The cold front is projected to push through central\nIllinois on Tuesday morning, bringing isolated showers to the\narea through the day. The post frontal airmass will remain\nconducive for rainfall with 30-50 pct PoPs expanding from across\nthe area north of I-70 through Wednesday. A warm front arriving\nfrom the west on Thursday morning will keep those rain chances\nin the forecast Wed night and Thursday.",
